<title>HUNGARY: Budapest bourse to delist Fonix on Dec 31.</title>
<headline>Budapest bourse to delist Fonix on Dec 31.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange (BSE) announced it would delist the stocks of holding company Fonix Rt on December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>The last day when investors can conclude any deals for the shares will be December 20, the BSE said in the official bourse gazette.</p>
<p>Fonix decided at its annual shareholders meeting on August 27 to ask the delisting of its shares. It lodged its request to the bourse on September 9.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
